publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T15:47:53.6687815Z               "message": "Add compatible owner transfer\n\nGlitchTip exposes a set_owner route that guarantees a single organization owner. Require a current owner, lock the organization and target membership, promote the target and demote every other owner to admin atomically, and return the committed member while rejecting admins, missing targets, malformed IDs and queries.",
